OL,3,GNEWSAJustice minister 'deeply
OL,4,Aconcerned' over temporary release of
OL,5,Aconvicted killer
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe justice minister remains "deeply
OL,8,Fconcerned" about the circumstances
OL,9,Fsurrounding the temporary release of a
OL,10,Fconvicted murderer.
OL,12,FThe NI Prison Service (NIPS) refused
OL,13,FGary Anderson permission to attend his
OL,14,Ffather's funeral but that decision was
OL,15,Fquashed by the courts.
OL,17,FAnderson was released on Monday from
OL,18,FMaghaberry Prison to attend the funeral
OL,19,Fbut absconded and remains at large.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
